FRAME_CHI7|id=F2.6|n=6|E_G2=35:1|relation=GREATER_OR_EQUAL|E_H_lower_bound=36|E_H_exact=CANNOT_PREDICT|reason=G2-fixed tensors are H-fixed; for even n, sum_i x_i^4 times q to the power (n-4) over 2 is H-fixed and not a multiple of q to the power n over 2, and Sym^n of 7 has G2-fixed dimension 1:1 (G2_FIXED row), so the count of F2.4 adds 1|status=PREDICTION|claim=NAMED|json=0
